at: 2026-11-24
by: r1/web-numeric-root

n: 4.4.8.8
name: four-separable-stages
kind: finding
is: Keep four bets separable, in this order: a content-addressed node space with name lenses for the kernel's own vocabulary; host programming languages as namespaces; natural-language lenses for controlled fragments; open natural language, stated as a direction only. Each stage has value without the next.
status: inferred
conf: high
from: 4.4.1.2 4.4.1.7 4.4.2.1 4.4.2.3
