n: 4.4.9
name: drop
kind: hub
is: What the study advises against: one universal construct set for all host languages; full host-language semantics inside the kernel; text-to-node as a function; one marker for several kinds of absence; a tree editable only through its own editor and a file per node; pivot concepts named in one language and self-description read as completeness.
at: 2026-11-24
