n: 4.4.9.2
name: host-semantics-inside-the-kernel
kind: finding
is: Drop writing full semantics of host languages inside the kernel. The K framework's semantics for LLVM, Python, Java, JavaScript and x86-64 were each archived within one to seven years; the ones still maintained are C and small virtual machines. Carry the host language's structure and delegate execution to its toolchain.
status: inferred
conf: mid
from: 4.4.1.8
