n: 4.4.9.4
name: one-marker-many-readings
kind: finding
is: Drop two ways of repeating SQL's NULL: one undecided representation for both nothing and fail, and a propagation rule picked per operator; do not grow the state set to four or five values either. Axiom 1 already gives nothing three roles (potential field, timeout, chosen option), so the readings must be told apart beside the state.
status: inferred
