is: Drop pivot concept nodes labelled in one language's words, as AMR's English-geared vocabulary shows. Drop reading 'the grammar fully describes itself' as a completeness claim: a system that describes itself in its own numbers inherits incompleteness, so the claim means executable self-description only.
